{"url": "https://x.com/zalberico/status/2100762087601680481", "id": "2100762087601680481", "text": "My @bot creates \"The Family Daily\" a daily family newspaper front-page using source inputs from an always on computer (like a Mac mini).\n\nhttps://x.ai/bot/FwJmagPaEeQ_so8TTK1gh\n\nYour family chat, calendar, email, WhatsApps - the bot automatically detects important signal and conflicts and updates the shared front page for everyone.\n\nYou can then optionally have the bot publish them to an e-ink display (on which the bot will install custom firmware for you and then run a local server to push to it for you).\n\nMine automatically publishes a morning, afternoon, and evening edition.", "raw_text": {"text": "My @bot creates \"The Family Daily\" a daily family newspaper front-page using source inputs from an always on computer (like a Mac mini).\n\nhttps://t.co/bCJ8MH6IL5\n\nYour family chat, calendar, email, WhatsApps - the bot automatically detects important signal and conflicts and updates the shared front page for everyone.\n\nYou can then optionally have the bot publish them to an e-ink display (on which the bot will install custom firmware for you and then run a local server to push to it for you).\n\nMine automatically publishes a morning, afternoon, and evening edition.", "display_text_range": [0, 569], "facets": [{"type": "mention", "indices": [3, 7], "original": "bot", "id": "2085838061347217408"}, {"type": "url", "indices": [138, 161], "original": "https://t.co/bCJ8MH6IL5", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/FwJmagPaEeQ_so8TTK1gh", "display": "x.ai/bot/FwJmagPaEe\u2026"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "zalberico", "url": "https://x.com/zalberico", "id": "50761855", "followers": 758, "following": 1013, "likes": 28463, "media_count": 28, "name": "Zach Alberico", "description": "save the shire @palantirtech", "raw_description": {"text": "save the shire @palantirtech", "facets": []}, "location": "\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/pro